        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mona Lisa</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1503 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leonardo-da-vinci">Leonardo da Vinci</a>, probably for the Florentine <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/silk">silk</a> merchant Francesco del Giocondo and his wife Lisa, though some scholars name a different commission; Leonardo never gave it to the Giocondo family</span></div>
